<aside class="crisis-box" aria-labelledby="crisis-heading">
  <h2 id="crisis-heading">Need help right now?</h2>
  <p>Our apps aren't for emergencies, and our team doesn't monitor what you enter in them.</p>
  <ul>
    <li>In an emergency, call <a href="tel:911">911</a>.</li>
    <li>Call or text <a href="tel:988">988</a> to reach the <a href="https://988lifeline.org">988 Suicide &amp; Crisis Lifeline</a>, free and open 24/7.</li>
    <li>For free, confidential treatment referrals, call <a href="https://www.samhsa.gov/find-help/national-helpline">SAMHSA's National Helpline</a> at <a href="tel:18006624357">1-800-662-4357</a>, open 24/7 in English and Spanish.</li>
  </ul>
</aside>
